SUMMARY:It's a Grinder Big Jon Said!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nMeetup Point: 6607 45\, Alnwi
 ck/Haldimand\, ON K0K 1C0\n\n### 🌲 Morris Trailhead – Northumberland 
 Forest 🌲\n\nReady to get lost in the woods—in the best possible way? 
 😎🥾\n\nMorris Trailhead in Northumberland Forest is a great escape in
 to nature\, with winding forest trails\, towering trees\, rolling terrain 
 and plenty of those *“wow\, look at this!”* moments along the way.\n\n
 To quote Jon: It's got a couple of good hills!\n\nThis hike is all about e
 njoying the outdoors\, getting some fresh air and having a good time with 
 fellow hikers. Expect a mix of woodland paths\, gentle climbs\, beautiful 
 scenery and a few opportunities to test those legs! 🌿🌲\nAnd\, of cou
 rse\, the best part of hiking is what happens between the trails—great c
 onversations\, new friends\, plenty of laughs and the occasional snack bre
 ak. 😉\n**So lace up your boots\, bring your water\, and come explore No
 rthumberland Forest with us!**\n🥾 **Good boots recommended**\n💧 **Br
 ing plenty of water**\n🌲 **Nature + fresh air + good company = a pretty
  great day!**\nCome for the hike. Stay for the adventure!
