SUMMARY:Barbecue and Hike through Tommy Thompson Park.
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nLocation: Meet at the entranc
 e of Tommy Thompson Park -Leslie Street Spit\n**It's time to have some fun
 !**\nWhat better way to celebrate the end of Summer with a barbecue by the
  lake. Join us for burgers and drinks **under the tents** and on the water
  at Ashbridges Bay for burgers and drinks!\nAfter a 8km hike at Tommy Thom
 pson Park we will head to Ashbridges Bay for burgers- veggie and meat.\nFe
 el free to bring alcoholic beverages\, andboard games - We will have a bea
 ch ball.\n\nTommy Thompson Park is a man-made urban wilderness and wildlif
 e sanctuary built on the Leslie Street Spit\, stretching 5 kilometers to L
 ake Ontario.\nManaged by the Toronto and Region Conservation Authority\, t
 his unique park offers a peaceful escape from the city with a mix of wetla
 nds\, meadows\, and trails.\nA unique place near downtown Toronto to exper
 ience nature\, and *one of the best places for bird-watching in the city*\
 , with more than 300 recorded species!
