SUMMARY:Now For Something Arty!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**Meetup: St. Mathews Clubhou
 se\; 450 Broadview Ave.**\nSo while we have a day event on the 27th\, if y
 ou have an arty side\, continue your day by joining me at St. Mathew's Clu
 bhouse for an arty experience.\nWhile many of you know I am a writer by tr
 ade\, I am also a painter. I just an arty girl! I have put together an Art
  Collective with 5 6 artists along with myself to showcase and of course s
 ell our work but also enjoy\nArt\, Wine & Inspiration — Come Create With
  Us! 🍷\nJoin us for a free collective art show celebrating creativity\,
  connection and the joy of making art.\n\nAnd why just look at art when yo
 u can explore your own creativity too? Come discover what inspires you\, t
 ry something new\, and let your imagination wander.\n✨ Art to explore.\n
 🍷 Wine to enjoy\; nibbles to share.\n🥂 Hear from the.artists!\n🎨 
 Creativity to discover.\n💫 And best of all — it’s FREE
